      "content": "hey so i had the flu like 3 weeks ago and im finally feeling better mostly but i still feel super wiped out. like everything is just heavy. i also get these weird heart palpitations and my chest feels kind of tight/heavy when i try to do anything like walk up stairs. is this just like long term fatigue or should i be worried about something else??",
