    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i just don't really want to deal with the doctor right now lol. doctors always make things sound way worse than they are and i'm broke. do you think it's possible i'm just really dehydrated or maybe low on electrolytes? could i just try taking some magnesium and resting for a week to see if it goes away? i feel like it's probably just my body still recovering from being sick.",
