      "content": "i hear you but honestly like... i checked my pulse and it seems okay, just a bit irregular sometimes. and the chest thing is mostly just when i'm moving around. it's probably just my heart working a bit harder because i'm still weak from being sick. if i just take a high dose of some vitamins and basically stay in bed for the next few days, wouldn't that be the safest way to just let my body bounce back without the stress of a clinic visit? i really feel like i just need more time to recover.",
